# Extra packages on the live ISO for the installer itself (added to releng's
# list by iso/build). The installer works without them, just plainer.
gum
# Partitions: GParted to delete, resize or move partitions before installing
# (GNOME Disks is already there from the default apps). xhost lets GParted,
# which runs as root, open its window on the live desktop.
gparted
xorg-xhost
# The firewall, on during the live session as on an installed system
firewalld
